msgstr ""
"<strong>ICC.gg Sign-In for OpenID Connect %1$s está disponible.</strong> "
"Estás ejecutando la versión %2$s."

#: includes/functions.php:159 includes/icc-gg-sign-in-openid-connect-settings-page.php:671
